### List banners
GET http://localhost:5000/api/banners?page=1&limit=10

### Search banners
GET http://localhost:5000/api/banners?q=The

### Get one
GET http://localhost:5000/api/banners/banners-1

### Create (admin token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/banners
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Golden Hour Banner",
  "placement": "Movies top",
  "active": true
}
